        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A product specification (product spec) is a detailed document that outlines the technical, functional, and design requirements of a product."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A product specification (product spec) is a detailed document that outlines the technical, functional, and design requirements of a product. It serves as a guide for engineers, designers, and manufacturers to ensure the final product meets expectations."
      }
