      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Use Process defines actions used by elements."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The UseProcess is an abstract class used to define processes that interact with key elements. Plan, state, and inspection processes plus managing boundaries are critical processes used by elements.\n\nRelationship:\n\nFor each UseProcess or subclass except the PlanProcess there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'affects’ on the from and a /Core/Element class or subclass on the to."
      }
    ],
