      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "When a VEX product element is related with a VexNotAffectedVulnAssessmentRelationship\nand a machine readable justification label is not provided, then an impactStatement\nthat further explains how or why the product(s) are not affected by the vulnerability\nshall be provided."
      }
    ]
  },
