      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A PlanAction involves the execution of a plan in relation to a PlanProcess."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A PlanAction involves the execution of a plan in relation to a PlanProcess.\n\nThe description of the PlanAction is a mandatory property.\n\nRelationship:\n\nFor each PlanAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'generates’ on the to and a PlanProcess class or subclass on the from."
